          "section_path": "Chapter 8 › Introduction to linear regression › 8.2 Least squares regression › 8.2.3 Conditions for the least squares line › IDENTIFYING THE LEAST SQUARES LINE FROM SUMMARY STATISTICS",
          "roles": [
